  "interpretation_zh": "同一虚拟环形几何的九相机控制已经达到 546/546 个严格单元和 13/13 个完整组，十二相机也达到相同通过数。因此，不能把改善归因于额外三台相机；可支持的结论是虚拟环形几何/覆盖让 Case 5 的 K16 reference 达到充分性。v208 在师兄提供的九相机标定族上的失败，不是 Case 5 数据、网格或 K16 本身必然不可重建。",
  "interpretation_en": "The nine-camera control under the same virtual-ring geometry already reaches 546/546 strict-safe cells and 13/13 complete groups, and the twelve-camera arm reaches the same pass counts. The improvement therefore cannot be attributed to three additional cameras. The supported conclusion is that the virtual-ring geometry or coverage makes the Case 5 K16 reference adequate. The v208 failure under the supplied nine-camera calibration family is not intrinsic to the Case 5 data, grid, or K16 alone.",
